<title>FRANCE: French prod prices seen up slightly in Q3 - survey.</title>
<headline>French prod prices seen up slightly in Q3 - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French producer prices are expected to rise slightly in the third quarter, especially in the semi-finished and automobile sectors, national statistics institute INSEE said in its quarterly survey of industry.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures for output prices, by percentage change from previous quarter (seasonally adjusted unless stated)</p>
<p>					     Q397    Q297    Q197     Q496</p>
<p>Price change of pvs quarter (unadj) =	-0.1    -0.1     -0.2</p>
<p>  -- Manufacturing industry	   =	-0.1    -0.5	0.1</p>
<p>  -- Semi-finished goods		=	-0.1    -0.5	0.3</p>
<p>  -- Consumer goods		     =	 0.0    -0.3     -0.1</p>
<p>Price change expected next quarter 0.2	0.1    -0.2     -0.1</p>
<p>  -- Manufacturing industry	  0.2	0.0    -0.2     -0.2</p>
<p>  -- Semi-finished goods	     0.5	0.2    -0.5	0.1</p>
<p>  -- Consumer goods		   -0.1	0.1    -0.1	0.0</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
